    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/2d751b8a796f7ab6b007a017e6a754ac.avif?t=1748622985\" data-has-big width=800 height=553 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/93b97feb43da9643d59d26f085ee3729.avif?t=1748622985\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/0da3117ba67381a35fca71907f496d51.poster.avif?t=1748622985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/0da3117ba67381a35fca71907f496d51.webm?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/0da3117ba67381a35fca71907f496d51.mp4?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>THE LEGACY OF LIVING NARRATIVE</strong>, in THE BANDONA'S STORY, you're not a mere spectator\u2014you are Joseph, a young man marked by physical and emotional scars, forced to confront a past that insists on shaping his future. The kingdom around you isn't a static backdrop, but a living organism where every village hides untold stories, every forest whispers ancient secrets, and every ruin bears the weight of past choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, your decisions aren't empty dialogues or superficial consequences. They echo through the world, altering alliances, rewriting destinies, and uncovering truths that may change your perception of reality\u2014and of yourself. You'll face dilemmas where the line between right and wrong blurs: saving a village may doom a people; the justice you seek could become another's oppression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an RPG where the narrative doesn't just unfold\u2014it breathes, reacts, and remembers. What will you do when you discover your greatest enemy might be the reflection of your own choices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/13a81d5028f926cd605b7bbfbda5f241.avif?t=1748622985\" data-has-big width=800 height=397 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/89969687e322c0812bec440d185ecea6.avif?t=1748622985\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/79cdf1b420c5bc778edaea23ddf4bc46.poster.avif?t=1748622985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/79cdf1b420c5bc778edaea23ddf4bc46.webm?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/79cdf1b420c5bc778edaea23ddf4bc46.mp4?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>THE ART OF WAR</strong>, forget acrobatic strikes or flashy spells\u2014in THE BANDONA'S STORY, combat is a lethal dance of steel, tactics, and instinct. Every enemy is a calculated threat, every move a gamble with consequences. You won't defeat foes through brute force, but through precision, adaptation, and above all, respect for danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons have real weight. A mistimed attack leaves you exposed; a failed defense means genuine pain. Here, victory isn't about strength\u2014it's about cunning: exploiting weaknesses, using the environment, and sometimes retreating to fight another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the dust settles, the scars will remain\u2014both on your hands and in your mind. Because in a world where every wound tells a story, survival is just the first step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/3f6e50fd623256bb9dfcf09af6dc08f5.avif?t=1748622985\" data-has-big width=800 height=397 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/01ce689a3a4575065a9e6f14aa7254ab.avif?t=1748622985\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/07aa8736a0f33b2b4f8ca980a51db5bd.poster.avif?t=1748622985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/07aa8736a0f33b2b4f8ca980a51db5bd.webm?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/07aa8736a0f33b2b4f8ca980a51db5bd.mp4?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>THE WEIGHT OF MORALITY</strong>, nothing here is simple. No choice comes with a &quot;happily ever after&quot; guarantee. In THE BANDONA'S STORY, you'll face dilemmas where every option costs something\u2014or someone. Saving a lost child might mean betraying a crucial faction; the truth you seek could destroy what little family remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a tale of good versus evil, but of conflicting interests, survival, and moral ambiguity. Characters have complex motivations\u2014allies may become traitors, enemies may reveal themselves as victims. The world judges your morality not through obvious means, but through whispered rumors, distrustful glances, and doors that close because you didn't play the &quot;hero.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You weren't born to save the world. Only to understand it\u2014and decide which parts are worth saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/c891e538e0ea668ab2139c328123c154.poster.avif?t=1748622985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/c891e538e0ea668ab2139c328123c154.webm?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/c891e538e0ea668ab2139c328123c154.mp4?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/288969a77cba4b48becbf5217561811b.poster.avif?t=1748622985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/288969a77cba4b48becbf5217561811b.webm?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/288969a77cba4b48becbf5217561811b.mp4?t=1748622985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/b7b7a610c6409817275a90e74552adba.avif?t=1748622985\" width=800 height=66 /></span>Embark on a timeless odyssey through Bandona's infinite cosmos\u2014a semi-open world where destiny intertwines with myth, and every step reveals echoes of a forgotten homeland. Here, adventure isn't just a path forward, but a return to your truest self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forged in fire and legend, Bandona awaits those who dare seek meaning beyond the horizon. A realm where medieval sagas breathe life into the unknown, and every challenge carries whispers from the ancients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a journey. It's a homecoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427910/extras/5ce994c3e09f97b5eb8b95870ded3412.avif?t=1748622985\" width=616 height=236 /></span></p>",
